ed." :question/worked-solution "Remember that $\\mathbb{Q}_0^{+}$ is the set of all positive rational numbers and zero.\n\n- $-\\frac{20}{8}=-\\frac{5}{2}$: It is negative, and it is a rational number but not an integer. Therefore, it does *not* belong to $\\mathbb{Q}_0^{+}$.\n\n- $-\\frac{7}{8}$: It is negative, and it is a rational number but not an integer. Therefore, it does *not* belong to $\\mathbb{Q}_0^{+}$.\n\n- $2\\sqrt{7}$: It is positive, and it is an irrational real number. Therefore, it does *not* belong to $\\mathbb{Q}_0^{+}$.\n\n- $3\\sqrt{2}$: It is positive, and it is an irrational real number. Therefore, it does *not* belong to $\\mathbb{Q}_0^{+}$.\n\nIn conclusion, the correct answer is: None of those listed."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186624696 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186054816 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "1d132801-b9cc-5c0c-a8fa-0c8b840c05bd" :knowledge-point/title "Identifying Sets Containing a Given Element"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "1c596f89-4808-5215-ad23-c0d60d4228cd" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186624678} {:answer/id #uuid "57e09251-ce8d-50a4-ae5d-2df4de6ebfd1" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186624691}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "1c596f89-4808-5215-ad23-c0d60d4228cd" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186624678} :answer-field/id #uuid "182d2acc-f468-52c4-a3d6-9cf8c5ccd4d5" :answer-field/key "$\\mathbb{R}_0^{-}$" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186624677} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "46d56a28-9931-53e4-a27b-9f556f292f98" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/i